      "items": [
        {
          "text": "主な舞台は街 Looty Bay。車で街に入り、戦利品を集めて無事に出るのが基本の流れ。パーティーは最大 3 人",
          "kind": "official",
          "refs": [
            {
              "news": "1843481262692060",
              "title": "ROB RUN: Your First Look at Looty Bay"
            },
            {
              "news": "1849192144187218",
              "title": "ROB RUN: Answering Your Most Frequently Asked Questions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "マスクをかぶると犯罪者になる。かぶる前は安全に下見でき、目当ての建物や逃げ道を確かめられる",
          "kind": "official",
          "refs": [
            {
              "news": "1844115010491502",
              "title": "ROB RUN: Gameplay Overview"
            },
            {
              "help": "https://kefirgames.helpshift.com/hc/en/14-rob-run/faq/1347-how-do-i-pull-off-heists-in-looty-bay/",
              "title": "How do I pull off heists in Looty Bay?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "警察も本物のプレイヤー。街に入るたびに犯罪者か警察かを選べる",
          "kind": "official",
          "refs": [
            {
              "news": "1844115010491502",
              "title": "ROB RUN: Gameplay Overview"
            },
            {
              "news": "1845383656385404",
              "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "進め方は自由。強盗・積荷の運搬・拠点での生産・警察・土地の取り合いから選ぶ。操作に迷ったらモーテルの Lenny に聞く",
          "kind": "official",
          "refs": [
            {
              "help": "https://kefirgames.helpshift.com/hc/en/14-rob-run/faq/1342-what-should-i-do-after-the-intro-quests/",
              "title": "What should I do after the intro quests?"
            },
            {
              "help": "https://kefirgames.helpshift.com/hc/en/14-rob-run/faq/1354-how-do-i-make-money/",
              "title": "How do I make money?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "武器は街の戦利品のほか、闇市 (Lenny、または拠点のノートパソコン) で買える。発売時に基本のピストルが値下げされた",
          "kind": "official",
          "refs": [
            {
              "help": "https://kefirgames.helpshift.com/hc/en/14-rob-run/faq/1343-where-can-i-find-weapons/",
              "title": "Where can I find weapons?"
            },
            {
              "news": "1848557880479055",
              "title": "ROB RUN: First Changes & Server Schedule"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "死んだときに失う物は場所で違う。街の犯罪者は鞄の中身、砂漠では戦利品のすべて。装備は死ぬたびに耐久が減り、いまは修理できない",
          "kind": "official",
          "refs": [
            {
              "help": "https://kefirgames.helpshift.com/hc/en/14-rob-run/faq/1344-what-do-i-lose-when-i-die/",
              "title": "What do I lose when I die?"
            },
            {
              "news": "1849192144187218",
              "title": "ROB RUN: Answering Your Most Frequently Asked Questions"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
